    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "content": "### HDFS\n\n**N/A in this MVP:** HDFS logical capacity, NameNode health, DataNode health, IO, and block health are not exposed in Prometheus format. The dashboard is prepared for a future exporter using `cluster=gitjob`, `role=hdfs-namenode|hdfs-datanode`, `instance`, and `datanode_uuid`, so cluster and per-DataNode panels can be added without changing existing system queries. Use the HDFS runbook and `hdfs dfsadmin -report`/`fsck` for authoritative checks; do not infer HDFS capacity from host disk metrics.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "HDFS status",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Spark / Collector\n\n**N/A in this MVP:** Spark master/worker/executor resources, application/job distribution, stage duration, shuffle, spill, and Collector business counters are not exposed in Prometheus format. Future metrics should use `cluster=gitjob`, `role=spark-master|spark-worker|spark-executor`, `instance`, `application_id`, `executor_id`, and `worker`; the Worker / executor variable is reserved for that extension. No fake or mock values are shown.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Spark and Collector status",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gitjob-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 - (avg by (cluster, role, instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{cluster=\"gitjob\",instance=~\"$instance\",mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} / {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CPU usage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gitjob-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{cluster=\"gitjob\",instance=~\"$instance\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{cluster=\"gitjob\",instance=~\"$instance\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{role}} / {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Memory usage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gitjob-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
