    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Metric coverage\n\n**Collected by this MVP:** node-exporter CPU, memory, root disk, disk I/O, network I/O, Prometheus scrape health, and Kafka exporter broker/topic/consumer-lag metrics when the exporter is reachable. Targets are grouped by `cluster`, `role`, and `instance`; adding a node-exporter target does not require query edits.\n\n**Not collected yet:** HDFS logical capacity/block health, Spark applications/executors/stages/shuffle/spill, and Collector success/failure/processed counters. Those require a Prometheus-format endpoint or exporter and remain N/A rather than fabricated.\n\nUse the Instance and Worker / executor variables when future targets expose those labels, and use the dashboard time range to compare 1.00x → 1.30x → 1.69x → 2.20x benchmark runs after benchmark instrumentation is available.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Coverage and benchmark note",
      "type": "text"
    }
